# Kabbalah adventure: smoke-state-00
# First of 192 baked gentle physics-informed smoke states, drawn as irregular solid contours. The game displays consecutive states on settled actions; no idle animation.
# Actual runtime triangles; +Y up; metres; no image planes or textures.
# Base inks are semantic materials. The game maps them to its discrete lighting palette.
